Hello soldiers!

In these hot summer days came hot update!
A new furious mode has been added to the game: DOMINATION! In this mode, everyone can rely only on themselves! It does not have the usual choice of teams and weapons - you will be asked to choose a weapon just before the respawn.
In addition to the changes in the balance of weapons, a large number of new weapons were added to the game: SVT40, SVUAS, M110, KEDR, KASHTAN, MP7, NEGEV, XM8, AK74, ABAK, AK103, BEKAS12M, MOSSBERG500, NEOSTEAD2000, HONCHO, M2, M4, BROWING, 500 WALTHER, CZ75, SWM29, FALSHION and KUKRI. Great news for MEGAPACK owners - all new weapons are automatically issued to you!
The issue of weapons for premium and level has been changed.
Added new maps for some modes.

Full list of changes:

 Added a new mode - DOMINATION (free for all);
 Changed the issuance of weapons for premium:

 players who have not reached level 10 receive a KASHTAN submachine gun, a MOSSBERG500 shotgun and a CZ75 pistol;
 upon reaching level 10, in addition to KASHTAN, MOSSBERG500 and CZ75, the AK74 automatic and the L96A1MOD sniper rifle are also issued;

 Changed the issue of weapons by level:

 Level 2 - BROWNING pistol;
 Level 3 - KEDR submachine gun;
 Level 4 - FALSHION knife;
 Level 5 - BEKAS12M shotgun;
 Level 7 - SVT40 sniper rifle;
 Level 9 - M2 shotgun;
 Level 11 - SWM29 pistol;
 Level 12 - KUKRI knife;
 Level 13 - XM8 automatic;
 Level 15 - MP7 submachine gun;
 Level 16 - M110 sniper rifle;
 Level 17 - AK103 automatic;
 Level 18 - NEGEV machine gun;

 The balance of weapons PSG1, VINTOREZ, VINTOREZ_DESERT changed;
 Added new maps for modes:

 BATTLE - FORPOST 3 and CHERNOBYL STATION;
 REZNYA - NEFERNO and ZIGZAG
 SURVIVAL - NIGHTMARE NIGHT, SHAPITO, DEAD FARM, HAMLET and INVANSION;

 A new weapon has been added to the store for purchase:

 SVUAS sniper rifle;
 ABAKAN machine;
 NEOSTEAD2000 shotgun;
 HONCHO shotgun;
 M4 shotgun;
 WALTHER pistol;

 An additional summer offer was launched to purchase in-game currency;
 Many other fixes and fixes.


ATTENTION! ATTENTION!
I would like to pay special attention to dishonest players who use third-party programs to get advantage in the game over other players - CHEATERS! All bans issued to players are manually issued by game moderators with 100% evidence of cheats! For some of you, this is not a revelation. False bans NO and NEVER! If you are a cheater, but you have not been banned yet - your luck is temporary - sooner or later you will be taken to the server with a moderator and you will be banned! Therefore, a strong request-advice-recommendation from the administration of the project - DO NOT USE CHEATS - YOU WILL BE BANNED! And taking into account the fact that there are no unban in the game at the moment, your ban can be long-term!
Manual blocking allows you to identify dishonest players with a 100% chance, but this has its drawbacks - moderators cannot be on servers 7 days a week 24 hours a day. Therefore, we decided to implement a system of reports on the players and it will be released in the next updates of the game.

We continue to work on the game and its improvement. It is impossible to correct all errors and bugs and add all ideas and developments at a time. But with your help the game will improve and develop. Do not be afraid to write your comments, suggestions and errors found!

Good game to everyone!
